      "content": "Thanks for that. Quick follow up on the pH part—you mentioned basic conditions hinder the reaction. Can you explain the specific molecular reasoning there? Like, why does a higher pH (alkaline environment) actually accelerate the browning process instead of hindering it? I think I might have misread my notes on that part.",
